# The `node_modules` directories in these fixtures are real fixture data: they
# model third-party packages whose input source maps must not escape their own
# package root. The repository root .gitignore already un-ignores
# `test/fixtures/**/node_modules`, but a `.gitignore` closer to the files wins
# over the root one, so repeat the negation here to keep the fixtures tracked
# even when tooling appends a broad `node_modules/` rule to the root file.
!**/node_modules
